le=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, its available NOW? I think I missed that backer update.</div> </div> </div> </div>I meant the compiled backer PDF. My baf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T01:48:36-07:00","id":1415659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415641#post1415641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh uh, if it's ok, may i asked a mummy question concerning merets (specifically from a section in the 2nd edition corebook)? I think it would fine to have it answered here but I'm not sure</div> </div> </div> </div>It is off-topic, but it should be ok to ask it here. I don't think they moderators mind if it is in good faith.<br /> People might not see it though.<br /> But i will. -subscribe-","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T02:21:26-07:00","id":1415661,"title":"","content":"I'm just waiting in silent excitement to see the expanded Minor Guilds writeups. I mean, there are a lot of cool things that I hope to see in this book, but this chapter is the one I am the most eager to see,","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T09:38:30-07:00","id":1415696,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415659#post1415659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It is off-topic, but it should be ok to ask it here. I don't think they moderators mind if it is in good faith.<br /> People might not see it though.<br /> But i will. -subscribe-</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok thank you! I promise this will be the only one<br /> <br /> In the section describing the timeless condition (to be more specific, the Timeless condition of Mummies, NOT the rules of storytelling Timelessness) it says mummies in a Meret may have differing memories between the interim of 1936 and 2019. One may remember having met in the 12th century during the interim, while another has no memory of that at all. Another remembers meeting at the dying years of the 21st century, while another has had so many Descents that the year 1936 is a distant memory. Toy understanding, Merets always awaken when another member does, and the section does say they remember meeting at those times none of the others do. Is this just the case of Memory being so wonky with Mummies? This is in page 79 by the way<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar503_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"503\" data-vbnamecard=\"503\">LostLight</a> yes very much! I'm excited to see all of them, ESPECIALLY the Wadjet-Itja. Of course I would like to see if they add the original ethos of the Maar-Kherit, but I'm sure they will focus on what they presently are. And whatever new guilds there are is sure to be exciting!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T10:45:39-07:00","id":1415699,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415696#post1415696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok thank you! I promise this will be the only one<br /> <br /> In the section describing the timeless condition (to be more specific, the Timeless condition of Mummies, NOT the rules of storytelling Timelessness) it says mummies in a Meret may have differing memories between the interim of 1936 and 2019. One may remember having met in the 12th century during the interim, while another has no memory of that at all. Another remembers meeting at the dying years of the 21st century, while another has had so many Descents that the year 1936 is a distant memory. Toy understanding, Merets always awaken when another member does, and the section does say they remember meeting at those times none of the others do. Is this just the case of Memory being so wonky with Mummies? This is in page 79 by the way</div> </div> </div> </div>Mummies simply wake up at different times that doesn't have to follow a chronological order. As you mentioned yourself, one of the mummies woke up in 1936, then in the 12th Century, and then in 2019. Some mummies within a meret can't remember previous shared Descents with the other mummies because those Descents have not yet happened for those mummies. It has nothing to do with Memory, though variable Memory certainly makes things even more confusing to straighten out for the Arisen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T13:11:04-07:00","id":1415722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415699#post1415699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mummies simply wake up at different times that doesn't have to follow a chronological order. As you mentioned yourself, one of the mummies woke up in 1936, then in the 12th Century, and then in 2019. Some mummies within a meret can't remember previous shared Descents with the other mummies because those Descents have not yet happened for those mummies. It has nothing to do with Memory, though variable Memory certainly makes things even more confusing to straighten out for the Arisen.</div> </div> </div> </div>So basically, though that mummy (the one with his descent in the 12th century) was the only one actually going through that Descent. The other ones may have been with the mummy in the 12th century, but from, that actual, conscious Descent never actually happened for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T13:37:49-07:00","id":1415729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415722#post1415722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So basically, though that mummy (the one with his descent in the 12th century) was the only one actually going through that Descent.</div> </div> </div> </div>Between Descents, the Arisen are wholly disconnected from their bodies and the world. They're basically outside of time, and their Descents are them returning back to the world and the timeline. They just don't necessarily do so in chronological order because <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415722#post1415722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The other ones may have been with the mummy in the 12th century, but from, that actual, conscious Descent never actually happened for them.</div> </div> </div> </div>If the other mummies of the meret were with him in the 12th century, then they will at some point have their Descents then as well. It just might be that the other mummies present at 2019 just haven't experienced that Descent just yet.<br /> (Except, theoretically speaking, if that particular timeline is altered so that Descent never happened, but the one mummy who already had that Descent will not have his own personal history altered just because it never happened.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T14:19:20-07:00","id":1415736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415729#post1415729\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Between Descents, the Arisen are wholly disconnected from their bodies and the world. They're basically outside of time, and their Descents are them returning back to the world and the timeline. They just don't necessarily do so in chronological order because <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> If the other mummies of the meret were with him in the 12th century, then they will at some point have their Descents then as well. It just might be that the other mummies present at 2019 just haven't experienced that Descent just yet.<br /> (Except, theoretically speaking, if that particular timeline is altered so that Descent never happened, but the one mummy who already had that Descent will not have his own personal history altered just because it never happened.)</div> </div> </div> </div>But I thought a Meret experiences the Descent together? When those other mummies finally go through the Descent their fellow did, will they probably have it play out fairly different from them? Or is it purely just the fact that those mummies were simply in Duat when that happened, and once they actually experience that Descent, they will experience the same things their friend (the mummy that actually went through the Descent before them) claims to remember them doing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T14:57:59-07:00","id":1415739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415736#post1415736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But I thought a Meret experiences the Descent together? When those other mummies finally go through the Descent their fellow did, will they probably have it play out fairly different from them? Or is it purely just the fact that those mummies were simply in Duat when that happened, and once they actually experience that Descent, they will experience the same things their friend (the mummy that actually went through the Descent before them) claims to remember them doing?</div> </div> </div> </div>They will all go through the same Descents. They just won't necessarily do it in the same order.<br /> <br /> A new example: A meret of three mummies goes through three Descents together during 1932, 1991 and 2044.<br /> Mummy A experiences the Descents in chronological order: 1932-&gt;1991-&gt;2044<br /> Mummy B experiences the Descents in this order: 1932-&gt;2044-&gt;1991<br /> Mummy C experiences the Descents in reverse chronological order: 2044-&gt;1991-&gt;1932<br /> <br /> During the Descent of 1932, C has already experienced two out of three Descents and knows the entire history of the meret, and is the one who convinces A and B to join up in the first place.<br /> During the Descent of 1991, everyone already knows each other and the cooperation flows relatively smoothly.<br /> During the Descent of 2044, C is the only one who has never met any of the others before despite C being the one who formed the meret; it just hasn't happened to C <i>yet</i>.<br /> <br /> All three Descents <i>are</i> experienced together by the whole meret, but each individual experiences them in their own order. That's the entire point of the section of text you talked about on page 79.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T15:05:06-07:00","id":1415742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415739#post1415739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They will all go through the same Descents. They just won't necessarily do it in the same order.<br /> <br /> A new example: A meret of three mummies goes through three Descents together during 1932, 1991 and 2044.<br /> Mummy A experiences the Descents in chronological order: 1932-&gt;1991-&gt;2044<br /> Mummy B experiences the Descents in this order: 1932-&gt;2044-&gt;1991<br /> Mummy C experiences the Descents in reverse chronological order: 2044-&gt;1991-&gt;1932<br /> <br /> During the Descent of 1932, C has already experienced two out of three Descents and knows the entire history of the meret, and is the one who convinces A and B to join up in the first place.<br /> During the Descent of 1991, everyone already knows each other and the cooperation flows relatively smoothly.<br /> During the Descent of 2044, C is the only one who has never met any of the others before despite C being the one who formed the meret; it just hasn't happened to C <i>yet</i>.<br /> <br /> All three Descents <i>are</i> experienced together by the whole meret, but each individual experiences them in their own order. That's the entire point of the section of text you talked about on page 79.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ohhh ok I get it now. I'm very sorry this off topic question lasted so long. Seriously thank you for taking the time to answer. I really appreciate it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T05:38:16-07:00","id":1415803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>White Oak Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415514#post1415514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, it was achieved, and those things are in the book. I wrote some of the new Utterances for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please, I was so disappointed that not all the stretch goals considering that book came to pass. Is there a way to achieve them anyway, something we could do in the mean time? A mini-kickstarter perhaps? Player guides are nice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26112-excess","name":"Excess","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T17:55:15-07:00","id":1415910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Excess</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415803#post1415803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Please, I was so disappointed that not all the stretch goals considering that book came to pass. Is there a way to achieve them anyway, something we could do in the mean time? A mini-kickstarter perhaps? Player guides are nice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not how it works and that sort of mentality (expressed rudely, thus coming off entitled) was cited as a reason why Onyx Path now restricts information on stretch goals until we're up to them.<br /> Not saying anything about you, but a lot people were salty about not getting the <i>Book of Going Westward </i>back in first edition.<br /> <br /> That said, the Storyteller's Vault is an option, if we want to write it ourselves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T18:32:15-07:00","id":1415917,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415910#post1415910\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not how it works and that sort of mentality (expressed rudely, thus coming off entitled) was cited as a reason why Onyx Path now restricts information on stretch goals until we're up to them.<br /> Not saying anything about you, but a lot people were salty about not getting the <i>Book of Going Westward </i>back in first edition.<br /> <br /> That said, the Storyteller's Vault is an option, if we want to write it ourselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>Praise the storyteller vault! But seriously, I'm just happy with what we got, it honestly did better than I thought considering how niche Mummy is","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-29T04:20:28-07:00","id":1415960,"title":"","content":"I suspect people will be pretty happy with what's ended up in the Book of Lasting Death - just wish I could tell you all about it already, but sadly we all need to wait a bit longer <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-29T06:58:15-07:00","id":1415966,"title":"","content":"It was worth the Consulting Dev tier, I can say that much.<br /> Some of my expectations had to be adjusted for size constraints but we do have plenty of awesomeness.<br /> <br /> It also suggested certain changes to the corebook, so there were things that appeared incomplete based on the KS manuscript. I am really excited to see the updated rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-29T07:31:29-07:00","id":1415970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415966#post1415966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It was worth the Consulting Dev tier, I can say that much.<br /> Some of my expectations had to be adjusted for size constraints but we do have plenty of awesomeness.<br /> <br /> It also suggested certain changes to the corebook, so there were things that appeared incomplete based on the KS manuscript. I am really excited to see the updated rules.</div> </div> </div> </div>Regarding changes to the corebook, will it be corrected that the Arisen refer to other immortals as the &quot;endless&quot;? I noticed in their section that it called them the Timeless instead","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-29T15:38:06-07:00","id":1416036,"title":"","content":"I think I've pushed the NDA as far as I can.<br /> Though to be fair, terminology was not the first change that came to mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-29T16:30:42-07:00","id":1416043,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1416036#post1416036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I've pushed the NDA as far as I can.<br /> Though to be fair, terminology was not the first change that came to mind.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ahh ok thank you. I'm REALLY sorry if I got you in a little trouble. I'm all outta questions now","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T18:00:43-07:00","id":1416393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415739#post1415739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They will all go through the same Descents. They just won't necessarily do it in the same order.<br /> <br /> A new example: A meret of three mummies goes through three Descents together during 1932, 1991 and 2044.<br /> Mummy A experiences the Descents in chronological order: 1932-&gt;1991-&gt;2044<br /> Mummy B experiences the Descents in this order: 1932-&gt;2044-&gt;1991<br /> Mummy C experiences the Descents in reverse chronological order: 2044-&gt;1991-&gt;1932<br /> <br /> During the Descent of 1932, C has already experienced two out of three Descents and knows the entire history of the meret, and is the one who convinces A and B to join up in the first place.<br /> During the Descent of 1991, everyone already knows each other and the cooperation flows relatively smoothly.<br /> During the Descent of 2044, C is the only one who has never met any of the others before despite C being the one who formed the meret; it just hasn't happened to C <i>yet</i>.<br /> <br /> All three Descents <i>are</i> experienced together by the whole meret, but each individual experiences them in their own order. That's the entire point of the section of text you talked about on page 79.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait. So really? I didn't realize that one could have player mummies also be out of since with each other. (Like how the Doctor and River Song seem to be at opposite ends of their timelines.) This idea is really really brilliant to me. <br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> As a note I am really looking forward to seeing the 'new' or I guess I should say updated version of the book based on feedback and goals because I think its going to be brilliant. That and having access to a table of contents and such to find stuff easier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T14:52:00-07:00","id":1416541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1416393#post1416393\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait. So really?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes indeed!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T17:49:27-07:00","id":1416556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1416541#post1416541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes indeed!</div> </div> </div> </div>Its quite fun to discover something that makes things even more awesome. <br /> <br /> So while mummies are great I'm almost equally or more excited about other immortals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T18:40:05-07:00","id":1416559,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1416556#post1416556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Its quite fun to discover something that makes things even more awesome. <br /> <br /> So while mummies are great I'm almost equally or more excited about other immortals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dude me too lol. Immortals and the minor guilds are equally interesting to me, and I cant wait to see what the companion has","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-03T08:17:06-07:00","id":1416620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1416559#post1416559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Dude me too lol. Immortals and the minor guilds are equally interesting to me, and I cant wait to see what the companion has</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm very much looking forward to the Reborn. I love the idea of playing a person who discovers memories of not just one old life but a sequence of them and then realizes that death doesn't stop them as they discover old powers begining to awaken and they realize that they don't have to start from scratch. Maybe through in some timey whimey stuff so that the can interact with old lives in fun ways or maybe add in power growth in this life and there is much potential.<br /> <br /> But yeah, its the Reborn out of all the other immortals that I LOVE the best. Especially the whole ability of them to gain Sekhem scores in the good way (that is 1 to 10) and also potentially Pillars and also multiple 'mortal only' supernatural powers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","user":"LordHeru","date":". 10-03-2020, 11:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-04T00:12:07-07:00","id":1416691,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1416043#post1416043\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ahh ok thank you. I'm REALLY sorry if I got you in a little trouble. I'm all outta questions now</div> </div> </div> </div>I did not receive a wa4ning, so I am probably not in trouble, but waiting until I do seems rude at best.<br /> <br /> On the topic of Immortals, I can say that none of the detailed ones in the corebook are revised HERE. Though there are a number of newly detailed ones for player usage. Oh and [REDACTED] makes a comeback","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-04T05:59:01-07:00","id":1416713,"title":"","content":"I remember that in one of the Podcasts Matthew mentioned in a discussion about Spilled Blood that the Everlasting sounds like something really fitting for Mummy that he may want to mention in Book of Lasting Death. I do not know if he actually did something with it, but considering that the Everlasting ARE very, very fitting for Mummy, I do hope that they were included. I guess I'll have to wait and see :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T03:52:08-07:00","id":1418797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1415910#post1415910\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not how it works and that sort of mentality (expressed rudely, thus coming off entitled) was cited as a reason why Onyx Path now restricts information on stretch goals until we're up to them.<br /> Not saying anything about you, but a lot people were salty about not getting the <i>Book of Going Westward </i>back in first edition.<br /> <br /> That said, the Storyteller's Vault is an option, if we want to write it ourselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry. I just was not ready for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26112-excess","name":"Excess","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T16:14:35-07:00","id":1418908,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Excess</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1415434-the-book-of-lasting-death-stretch-goal?p=1418797#post1418797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sorry. I just was not ready for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>It happened. Can't say I haven't thought about it myself, either.<br /> We all have bad days, and I like to think most of us don't mean to share them forcibly.<br /> Sorry if I came off too hard on you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}